    <description>A7, first trigger: filling a refusal reason on an open New clients or Repeat sales deal moves the same record to Reactivation. The refusal type picks the stage: waiting for next period and ignored land on their own stages, a true refusal lands on Deferred demand. The 5-to-7-days-silent trigger is the scheduled job SilentDealsJob (Apex).</description>
